+
+# 23. Examples
+
+### Example A — workshop base scalar
+
+```
+state_field: workshop__health__level
+max_level_field: workshop__health__max_level
+contributor_id: workshop__health__base
+semantic_type: base
+operation: set_base
+target_stat: health
