+
+# 24. Final rule
+
+If a naming or schema choice is:
+
+- neat
+- compact
+- elegant
+
+but **not truthful to the contributor semantics**,
+
+then **truth wins**.
+
+Pretty lies are still lies.
+
+The ledger should prefer **precise ugliness over elegant nonsense**.
